"""
Broski AI - Advanced Personal Assistant Backend
Designed for Linux first, with Windows fallbacks.

Core features:
- Voice input + text commands
- Text-to-speech
- OpenAI-powered conversational fallback
- Wikipedia search
- Website/app launcher with allowlists
- Time/date/system status
- Calculator
- Notes
- Flask API for index.html / Broski web UI
- Health/status endpoint
- Simple command router that is easy to extend

Install:
    pip install flask python-dotenv openai SpeechRecognition pyttsx3 wikipedia psutil

Linux microphone support may also need:
    sudo apt install portaudio19-dev python3-pyaudio espeak-ng

Create .env:
    OPENAI_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
    OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

Run:
    python broski.py

Web UI:
    http://127.0.0.1:5000
"""

